evidence.en:
function NewsletterCard() {
  const { pending } = useFormStatus(); // always false
  return (
    <section>
      <form action={subscribeAction}>
        <input name="email" />
        <button disabled={pending}>Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  );
}

useFormStatus reports the status of the nearest ___b1___ form element, and here it is called in the component that renders the form itself, so there is none above it. The hook does not error — pending is simply always ___b2___. The fix is moving the useFormStatus call into a ___b3___ component rendered inside the form.

